msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You may have lost hold on your old self,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫but somewhere deep down, you "
"kept calling for me,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫それでも、⟪k:3⟫たとえ君が自分を見失っても……⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫心のどこかで私を呼び続けてくれ"
