msgstr "⟪k:0⟫今のわたしは気持ち悪いでしょう……！"

#: scenario6:scenario6_1AB25D46_6BEB_4E6E_973E_C8B225EC1510
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b774220d180b988da468454a1f08ebc731c41021a5df6c71f81880d824435111
